# The scraper writes LF and a bot commits its output nightly. Without this, a
# Windows clone gets CRLF working files and every generated artifact looks
# rewritten to whoever diffs it next.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Collapse the machine-sized exports in diffs. ps/*.md stays visible — those are
# the human-browsable deliverable, and data/changelog/ is the readable diff.
data/ps.json    linguist-generated
data/ps.csv     linguist-generated
web/src/data/ps.json linguist-generated
